      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">School meal set disposable and compostable polylactide granulate for dishes</baseName>
        <treatmentStandardsRoutes> disposable and compostable</treatmentStandardsRoutes>
        <mixAndLocationTypes> polylactide granulate for dishes</mixAndLocationTypes>
      </name>
      <common:synonyms>Kit usa e getta compostabile per mensa scolastica</common:synonyms>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Systems</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Other systems</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment>The dataset has been developed in LIFE EFFIGE project. Details are given in “PEFCR of contracted supply service for school meals” (lifeeffige.eu). The background system is not included in the model. To complete the inventory, the use of data from other published database is necessary.</common:generalComment>
    </dataSetInformation>
    <quantitativeReference type="Reference flow(s)">
      <referenceToReferenceFlow>0</referenceToReferenceFlow>
    </quantitativeReference>
    <time>
      <common:referenceYear>2019</common:referenceYear>
      <common:dataSetValidUntil>2024</common:dataSetValidUntil>
    </time>
    <geography>
      <locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction location="IT"/>
    </geography>
    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The dataset includes a simplified model of tableset disposable and compostable.  Average data are provided concerning the amount of materials needed to supply a tableset suitable for school meals.  A typical tableset includes a placemate, a paper napkin, a glass, a set of cutlery, a couple of dishes. The background system is not included in the model. To complete the inventory, the use of data from other published database is necessary. </technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
      <technologicalApplicability>In agreement with the scope definition, the dataset shall be used for those cases where the impact of the meal kit is not the main contribution to the total impact of the investigated system. </technologicalApplicability>
    </technology>
  </processInformation>
